1
00:00:00,894 --> 00:00:03,024
(Nerdy Guy:)of infantry and military police.

2
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:07,330
(Leonard:)Uh-huh, I'm normally
very nice,

3
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:08,963
(Leonard:)but you shut up, too.

4
00:00:15,841 --> 00:00:17,341
(Sheldon:)So...

5
00:00:17,343 --> 00:00:20,173
(Sheldon:)what are you in for?

6
00:00:20,179 --> 00:00:23,849
(Nerdy Guy:)Honestly, I just wanted to meet
Mr. Lucas and say thank you.

7
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:27,290
(Nerdy Guy:)You know, growing up, the movies
had such an impact on my life.

8
00:00:27,287 --> 00:00:29,687
(Nerdy Guy:)I never really fit in anywhere.

9
00:00:29,689 --> 00:00:31,689
(Nerdy Guy:)Till I discovered
the worlds he created

10
00:00:31,691 --> 00:00:34,321
(Nerdy Guy:)and finally found a place
where I belong.

11
00:00:35,627 --> 00:00:37,767
(Sheldon:)But why are you here?

12
00:00:37,764 --> 00:00:39,434
(Nerdy Guy:)Oh, I, uh, I hopped a fence,

13
00:00:39,432 --> 00:00:41,102
(Nerdy Guy:)and they caught me
in the sculpture gallery

14
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,700
(Nerdy Guy:)making out
with a Chewbacca statue.

15
00:00:49,908 --> 00:00:59,018
(Howard:)Excuse me.

